## Production Deployment Checklist

1. [x] **MongoDB Replica Set**: Enforce replica set configuration in production to leverage native ACID transactions.
2. [x] **API Key Rotation**: Store `GEMINI_API_KEY` and `OPENROUTER_API_KEY` in environment secrets management (AWS Secrets Manager / GCP Secret Manager).
3. [x] **Rate Limiting**: Enable Express rate-limiting middleware (`express-rate-limit`) on `/api/document-intelligence/documents`.
4. [x] **Dead Letter Queue**: Configure Redis/BullMQ queue for handling unprocessed document fallback retries under heavy burst load.
